opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "MSVC from the environment"
description: """
opam's conf-msvc64 searches for a Visual Studio installation with
msvs-detect, which finds none on GitHub's Windows runners. The pixi
environment provides MSVC through its activation (dev/setup/activate.bat),
so this one takes it as it is, as this repository's ocaml-env-msvc64
does."""
